Section 15 of the Act of 2013 reads as under:-
"15. Hearing of objections :- (1) Any person interested in any land which has been notified under sub-section (1) of section 11, as being required or likely to be required for a public purpose, may within NEUTRAL CITATION NO. 2024:MPHC-JBP:55462 3 WP-33854-2024 sixty days from the date of the publication of the preliminary notification, object to-- (a) the area and suitability of land proposed to be acquired;
(b) justification offered for public purpose;
(c) the findings of the Social Impact Assessment report.
